  "body": "A HOME THAT'S READY TO BE ENJOYED - VENDORS HAVE BOUGHT!\r\n\r\nOur vendors have given us clear instructions: find someone who will love and enjoy their home as much as they have. Having invested over $100,000 in modernisation, they are now ready for their next move and invite your interest.\r\n\r\nArguably one of the best-presented and best-priced homes in Fairway Bay, this north-east-facing, single-level residence combines style, comfort and easy-care living. Outdoor living is a real highlight, with an approximately 15sqm Louvretec entertaining area, sun-filter blinds, beautifully landscaped gardens, irrigation and established fruit and vegetable gardens.\r\n\r\nThere is generous internal-access garaging and extra parking.  Residents enjoy exclusive access to Fairway Bay's heated swimming pool, tennis court and clubhouse facilities just stroll away.\r\n\r\nNot quite ready for a retirement village? This could be exactly what you've been waiting for - a beautifully presented lock up and leave with nothing to do.\r\n\r\nCall Roger on 029 666 66 66 or Emma on 021 392 262.\r\n\r\nOpen Homes: Sundays, 2.00-3.00pm",
